# Standardize PHPUnit Test Structure with setUp and Trait-Based Helpers: Test Classes Extend

## Policies

1. Test classes MUST extend PHPUnit\Framework\TestCase or an appropriate base test class
2. Test classes SHOULD use setUp() method for common initialization logic
3. Test classes SHOULD leverage trait-based helpers for reusable test utilities
4. Trait-based helpers MUST be prefixed with `Test` (e.g., `TestDatabaseHelpers`, `TestAuthHelpers`)
5. setUp() method MUST call parent::setUp() as the first statement
6. Test fixtures and mock objects SHOULD be initialized in setUp() rather than in individual test methods
7. Trait-based helpers MUST NOT contain test methods (only utility methods)
